#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:3
#: 08b03069d1b447bbacf47b6c1448e85b
msgid "小角度自旋倾斜（Small-Angle Spin Tilt）"
msgstr "Small-Angle Spin Tilt"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:5
#: 10083233104d4bf8828b8b9e0a079533
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:7
#: 35f88fb76d814e49a66d3c227014e5d2
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:9
#: c5d89f52c5ea4c3596d81ec405646561
msgid ""
"对选定目标原子、全局磁序或原子对做确定性小角度磁矩偏转（canting）。支持四种模"
"式：单自旋偏转、Global tilt、显式原子对 canting、两组原子的 group-pair "
"canting。pair 模式显式构造 S_i x S_j 的正/负手性对，直接服务于 DMI 训练集；"
"Global tilt 用于外场下的集体偏转角扫描。"
msgstr ""
"Apply deterministic small-angle canting to selected atoms, an entire "
"magnetic order, explicit atom pairs, or two labeled groups. Pair modes "
"generate opposite-chirality partners with positive and negative `S_i × S_j`, "
"which is useful for DMI training. Global tilt scans collective rotation, for "
"example along an approximate field-driven path."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:11
#: 82de30eb52fe49b0bcc64cf4f499e89b
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:13
#: 115431d5884a457caae80ad93fcf99b4
msgid ""
"\\hat{\\mathbf{m}}(\\theta)=\\cos\\theta\\,\\hat{\\mathbf{m}}_0+"
"\\sin\\theta\\,\\hat{\\mathbf{t}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:15
#: 19ba844ff08f412badce2e60c89b8e56
msgid "\\theta_L=+\\theta/2,\\qquad \\theta_R=-\\theta/2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:17
#: 4bedfa7ef7d84f4caaf21b81988ee7a0
msgid ""
"$\\hat{\\mathbf t}$ 是与参考磁矩 $\\hat{\\mathbf m}_0$ 正交的单位倾斜方向。成"
"对 canting 把总夹角 $\\theta$ 平分到左右自旋，使两者相对角度可控；正负手性通"
"过翻转 $\\hat{\\mathbf t}$ 或角度符号构造。磁矩模长保持不变。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:21
#: 5938ff8c50d7443e94ba3c8e380bc33a
msgid ""
"**关键限制：** 这是一张确定性卡片——没有随机采样。每个角度和每个目标都会生成确"
"定性的输出。需要随机方向扰动时用 `Magmom Rotation`。缺少磁矩、目标原子、有效 "
"pair 或 group 时会明确报错，不会返回原结构或只返回 reference 冒充完成。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:23
#: 05d6ad1244374efea175220a3d715a91
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:25
#: a85b734b443d4440a480793a9df867d0
msgid "场景：模型在 DMI 体系上手性相关的能量差完全预测反了"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: a model predicts the wrong sign for chirality-dependent energy "
"differences in a DMI system"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:27
#: 87ce18e457094a0c9f8c2178c03b8109
msgid ""
"你在一个非中心对称磁性体系上训练了 NEP 模型，所有训练数据来自 FM 和 AFM 共线"
"构型。模型拟合的交换作用还不错，但计算左手螺旋和右手螺旋的能量差时，符号反了"
"——它根本不知道 DMI 的方向偏好。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model for a noncentrosymmetric magnet using only "
"collinear FM and AFM configurations. Its symmetric exchange behavior is "
"reasonable, but it predicts the wrong sign for the energy difference between "
"left- and right-handed spirals because the training data contain no "
"information about DMI chirality."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:29
#: 10bf0cfcf3a54e6396ed2d07193f1945
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** DMI 的微观来源是 S_i x S_j 项。如果训练集里所有构型的 S_i 和 "
"S_j 都是完美共线（夹角 0 或 180 度），交叉积恒为零，模型无法学到 DMI。需要显"
"式加入相邻自旋有小角度偏差的构型，并且正负手性成对出现，让模型看到不同的 S_i "
"x S_j 值。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** DMI depends on `S_i × S_j`. When every training pair is "
"exactly parallel or antiparallel, that cross product is zero and its "
"handedness cannot be learned. Add neighboring-spin pairs with small relative "
"angles and include both signs as matched partners so the data expose the "
"antisymmetric response."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:31
#: c1aa4b9629d74146a08fb1760549a290
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个已有 `initial_magmoms` 的 bcc Fe 结构，或通过 "
"`magnitude_source = Map/default magnitude` 生成 FM 参考态"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A bcc Fe structure with `initial_magmoms`, or an FM reference "
"initialized with `magnitude_source = Map/default magnitude`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:33
#: 7dcf93eaf7054c6ba685056d098d059e
msgid ""
"**目标：** 对所有第一近邻 Fe-Fe 原子对做 ±1°/2°/5°/10° 的成对 canting，正负手"
"性成对输出，覆盖常见的 DMI 强度区间"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** For every first-neighbor Fe–Fe pair, generate paired chiralities "
"at ±1°, 2°, 5°, and 10° to probe the small-angle DMI response."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:35
#: 6250a55634da495d996e6f8f9e15728c
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:36
