#: 68b5f64ecfd24f77975ee87cb72a4f37
msgid "`倾斜角列表`（`angle_list`） = `1,2,5,10`"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:40
#: f96d074eb7f74ed49bd1f2ad23fd6304
msgid "`Tilt Signs` = `Both (+/- pair)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:41
#: e8c42c6e9bc84ecfbb64a95bc48947bd
msgid ""
"`Magnitude Source` = `Map/default magnitude`，`元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`） = "
"`Fe:2.2`"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:43
#: 66d8e9943bd54c65b7139c9ca984a586
msgid ""
"**输出：** 对每个第一近邻 Fe-Fe 对，4 个角度 x 2 种手性 = 8 个 canting 构型。"
"如果自动找到 4 个近邻对，共 ~32 个输出（含 reference 则为 33）。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Eight canted configurations per first-neighbor Fe–Fe pair: four "
"angles times two chiralities. If four pairs are selected automatically, this "
"gives about 32 outputs, or 33 with the reference state."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:45
#: 472fd7a4afa84526888c09140a3805cf
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:46
