msgid "重训后计算左手和右手螺旋构型的能量差，符号和趋势应该接近 DFT 参考"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, compare left- and right-handed spiral "
"energy differences with DFT; both sign and trend should agree."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:47
#: 39c329b7f112422795e9f77d30937fda
msgid "抽查一对 canting 输出：左侧原子磁矩偏 +theta/2，右侧偏 -theta/2"
msgstr ""
"Inspect a paired output: the left moment should rotate by `+theta/2` and the "
"right by `-theta/2`, with the opposite sample reversing the chirality."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:48
