msgid "目标原子索引（target_indices）"
msgstr "target_indices"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:86
#: 950085d2d65440988488cb0130f7a182
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。手动指定要倾斜的原子索引，格式如 `1,3-5`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. One-based atom indices to tilt, with ranges such as "
"`1,3-5`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:88
#: 7db1b06593f44f92ad363da94a3716f3
msgid "生效条件：`目标选择方式`（`target_mode`）使用手动索引时。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:90
#: d07ea6b0b07048438c2e2250eda74750
msgid "原子对目标"
msgstr "Atom-pair targets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:92
#: 1c91b0dde7e94112b3597563375bce21
msgid "左侧原子对索引（pair_left_indices）"
msgstr "pair_left_indices"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:94
#: 0563ab4fd0dd49a5ae8c1fa28ebe1b57
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。手动模式时，左侧原子 1-based 索引列表，与右侧一一配对。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. In manual mode, one-based indices for the left atoms, "
"paired position by position with the right list."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:96
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:102
#: 752dcb4ee1384215b415a63c5b6810cb 060066f74f45462ca454f1221ade78d5
msgid "生效条件：`原子对来源`（`pair_source`）选择手动索引时。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:98
#: a3c07fa9c2074defa2383fea8f91066e
msgid "右侧原子对索引（pair_right_indices）"
msgstr "pair_right_indices"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:100
#: 43ac4cfbc8b5420c9fdeb6a51ac7ec46
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。手动模式时，右侧原子 1-based 索引列表，与左侧一一配对。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. In manual mode, one-based indices for the right atoms, "
"paired position by position with the left list."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:104
#: 494c1419765541f6b4a1052a9a75282d
msgid "原子对来源（pair_source）"
msgstr "pair_source"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:106
#: ef986935d9c04110ae19c43e99ef7f08
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Manual indices'`。手动索引适合可控验证；自动近邻壳层适合批量生"
"成 DMI/交换路径样本，但需要检查元素对和键方向筛选。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Manual indices'`. Manual indices give controlled, "
"auditable pairs. Automatic neighbor shells generate DMI or exchange-path "
"samples in bulk, but their element and bond-direction filters must be "
"checked."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:108
#: bf07f8d46e0c4883b88d0275bb8db168
msgid "近邻壳层（pair_shell）"
msgstr "pair_shell"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:110
#: 21c232e67f334200be1d89e6b61e39f7
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`。自动模式时取第几近邻壳层。1 为第一近邻，2 为第二近邻。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `1`. Neighbor shell in automatic mode: 1 for first "
"neighbors, 2 for second neighbors."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:112
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:118
#: 8dd709555457493899a4d7dd83705f93 24d305519c1a459eac468b18779bcba9
msgid "生效条件：`原子对来源`（`pair_source`）选择近邻自动搜索时。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:114
#: 0429455118054100a68125e0fd121062
msgid "近邻壳层容差（pair_shell_tolerance）"
msgstr "pair_shell_tolerance"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:116
#: 39bd1e9405ae4783b297686e3b8eeeff
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.05`。自动分壳层的距离容差，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.05`. Distance tolerance in Å used to cluster "
"automatically detected neighbor shells."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:120
#: 76d8561d970c4566aa9950b5606e1071
msgid "原子对元素筛选（pair_element_filter）"
msgstr "pair_element_filter"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:122
#: 1a09bbf45b7b4d75b6ab35a6c5bbfab7
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。按元素对限制自动近邻 pair，例如 `Fe-Fe` 或 `Fe-Co`。DMI/交"
"换路径分析时务必匹配目标相互作用元素对。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Element-pair filter for automatic neighbors, such as "
"`Fe-Fe` or `Fe-Co`. Match it to the interaction channel being studied."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:124
#: 31cccd69d9814706a93c365ac5434d81
msgid "生效条件：自动生成原子对后需要按元素筛选时。"
msgstr "Use when automatically generated pairs must be filtered by element."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:126
#: a5c80f6e5c38428ebaa3e084019d8854
msgid "原子对分组筛选（pair_group_filter）"
msgstr "pair_group_filter"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:128
#: 86a19affd9594ec08e726a9d5d70c018
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。按 group 对限制自动近邻 pair，适合层状 AFM、界面或已标记子"
"晶格。没有上游 group 标签时不要使用。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Group-pair filter for automatic neighbors, useful for "
"layered AFM states, interfaces, or labeled sublattices. Do not use it "
"without upstream `group` labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:130
#: db39da97ebdd42ee99bf9657d16f8209
msgid "生效条件：自动生成原子对后需要按 group 筛选时。"
msgstr "Use when automatically generated pairs must be filtered by group."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:132
#: a269d2065d3142bebaf09e53bd142021
msgid "键筛选方式（bond_filter_mode）"
msgstr "bond_filter_mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:134
#: b258bcabb2904a8aaab6d7c95e1f06d7
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Any'`。`Any` 保留所有候选键；`Near axis` 选接近某方向的键；"
"`Near plane` 选接近某晶面的键，用于区分面内/面外相互作用。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Any'`. `Any` retains all candidate bonds. `Near axis` "
"selects bonds close to a direction; `Near plane` selects bonds close to a "
"plane, enabling in-plane and out-of-plane interaction channels to be "
"separated."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:136
#: a73a2be776f740d891b5a989ce457873
msgid "键筛选轴（bond_filter_axis）"
msgstr "bond_filter_axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:138
#: 429331b49460465a88e94b49dd1dacbc
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。研究面内/"
"面外 DMI 时必须和晶体取向一致。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Reference axis or plane normal for bond filtering. It must match the actual "
"crystal orientation in an in-plane/out-of-plane DMI study."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:140
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:146
#: ccff706659be470ba0d5b9107a3d6ef4 94175f07c2ce45278dc342fb78fd3281
msgid "生效条件：`键筛选方式`（`bond_filter_mode`）不是关闭状态时。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:142
#: 67001351b7074fa0be47cec0fc155974
msgid "键筛选容差（bond_filter_tolerance）"
msgstr "bond_filter_tolerance"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:144
#: 0503b668bb5146a7bfbaef15ae141658
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `20.0`。方向筛选容差——设太小可能找不到 pair，设太大会混入不该比"
"较的交换路径。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `20.0`. Angular tolerance for bond-direction filtering. "
"Too small may select no pairs; too large may mix distinct exchange paths."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:148
#: 3136100ea3884732aa7f888f4bbcec4b
msgid "Group Pair 模式"
msgstr "Group-pair mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:150
#: 17d8d1ea98c64dbbb9b35def2570b720
msgid "A 组（group_a）"
msgstr "group_a"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:152
#: 889d47c4682a46038841b95c63494b9c
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'A'`。`arrays['group']` 中的标签名。需要输入已有 group 标签。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'A'`. Label in `arrays['group']` for the first group. The "
"input must already contain group labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:154
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:160
#: 383e0a3ff31d4ad898dc289640454c6b 6a382cb01ee6491682e559f883d0972d
msgid "生效条件：需要 group pair、手动 group 或 AFM group 模式时。"
msgstr "Used by group-pair, manual-group, or AFM-group modes."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:156
#: 06f053bb49a94922acbed2ae1406ffdb
msgid "B 组（group_b）"
msgstr "group_b"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:158
#: 9f6b68541cba4610b493cb8bf4868df5
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'B'`。`arrays['group']` 中的标签名。需要输入已有 group 标签。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'B'`. Label in `arrays['group']` for the second group. The "
"input must already contain group labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:162
#: ac9c39256a964689818519c97226225d
msgid "角度和手性"
msgstr "Angles and chirality"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:164
#: 73efb98328d44a8783891395041b2bfc
msgid "倾斜角列表（angle_list）"
msgstr "angle_list"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:166
#: 6f855c3691d54e99a56b32851bf1a383
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'1,2,5,10'`。逗号分隔的偏转角列表，单位度。推荐从这个默认列表起"
"步。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'1,2,5,10'`. Comma-separated tilt angles in degrees. The "
"default is a practical small-angle starting set."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:168
#: 5944213b5c854a2ab3427576490febf9
msgid "倾斜符号（tilt_signs）"
msgstr "tilt_signs"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:170
#: e704805ddf254a8abeaeaba84ff6eda5
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Positive only'`。只做 +θ 可以验证局部响应；同时做 ±θ 才能提取手"
"性不对称项，DMI 数据建议用成对输出。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Positive only'`. A `+θ` sample is enough for a local-"
"response check. Matched `±θ` samples are required to isolate chirality-odd "
"contributions and are recommended for DMI data."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:172
#: e82f71b705e640b5b505da21d3f6f7f3
msgid "包含参考构型（include_reference）"
msgstr "include_reference"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:174
#: 0dd3480c7f134c53878775c2a911ea9f
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `True`。额外输出一帧未偏转的参考磁态，方便做 energy difference "
"对比。打开后 `最大输出数`（`max_outputs`）至少为 2，确保预算中还留有一帧真正"
"的 canting 输出。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:176
#: 390fc11abec94eedafdbb0f437992ba3
msgid "磁矩与参考态"
msgstr "Moments and reference state"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:178
#: 482d4e136ee345769e3f007e959a97ba
msgid "磁矩大小来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "magnitude_source"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:180
#: 5ca6fc9b76954027a49251ebb02cd3a2
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Existing initial magmoms'`。已有 `initial_magmoms` 时复用它最安"
"全；没有磁矩输入时用 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）/`默认磁矩`"
"（`default_moment`）构造幅值。不要用默认幅值替代已知元素磁矩。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:182
#: 7b3ab59addd64f67999ad188236de8eb
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:184
#: 2bfd8ad61a8944d7ba45022a1d2f40f8
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。已知元素局域磁矩时显式写入，如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。未知元素不"
"要用默认值伪造先验。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `''`. Provide known element-resolved local moments "
"explicitly, for example `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`. Do not invent a prior for an "
"unknown element through a default value."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:186
#: 1fc16900f2f84a86aed69df008e8ecd8
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:188
#: eb1b5decd09e4008b0cb7d83682fe5cd
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.0`。只作为 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）未命中元素的兜底幅"
"值。关键磁性元素应显式列出，非磁元素通常保持 0。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:190
#: 76379577fc8d459eaa2fe5365cac30e4
msgid "标量磁矩转为矢量（lift_scalar）"
msgstr "lift_scalar"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:192
#: 8a8085ebf98d4356a253c605693f9ebb
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `True`。输入是标量磁矩但下游需要非共线向量时打开；如果原始数据已"
"有方向信息，不要重新提升覆盖它。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `True`. Enable when scalar moments must be promoted to "
"noncollinear vectors. Do not promote again when the input already contains "
"directional information."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:194
#: ce543826ac2b4f9382e4e75b2ab309d4
msgid "轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:196
#: b096466fe898487290204720f1c413e9
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。这是方向"
"参考，不是普通数值——改它会改变分层、表面法向或磁矩方向。使用前先确认 cell 取"
"向和目标物理方向。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. This "
"is a directional reference, not an ordinary scalar setting: changing it "
"changes a layering direction, surface normal, or moment direction. Confirm "
"the cell orientation and intended physical direction first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:198
#: 6356358ec5f046d18f1e73bb038cbdda
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes that depend on a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:200
#: af91329aa1bf47558c7aa1eabd2c19f2
msgid "参考方向（reference_direction）"
msgstr "reference_direction"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:202
#: b97f6ad0b9614adcb8874fc0a73f039c
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)`。canting "
"平面的首选侧向参考方向。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)`. "
"Preferred transverse reference direction used to define the canting plane."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:204
#: ba21f7b9c4c244858c2946d369c2cfda
msgid "应用元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:206
#: fc63b09ac21042faac918e58fcd776a6
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。限制哪些元素参与目标筛选，留空则全部参与。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Restricts target selection to specified elements. "
