#: d186f2ea30f64a1ca0817822a6eda0e4
msgid ""
"无随机性。相同输入、相同参数 → 严格一致输出。`参考方向`"
"（`reference_direction`）会先对基准磁矩方向正交化，结果是确定性的。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**关键限制：** 这是一张确定性卡片——没有随机采样。每个角度和每个目标都会生"
#~ "成确定性的输出。需要随机方向扰动时用 `Magmom Rotation`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Important limitation:** This card is deterministic. Every selected "
#~ "target and angle produces a fixed output. Use `Magmom Rotation` for "
#~ "random directional perturbations."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果 DMI 仍不准，扩大 `Angle List` 到 `1,2,3,5,7,10,15`，增加第二近邻 "
#~ "`Pair Shell = [2]`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If DMI remains inaccurate, expand `Angle List` to `1,2,3,5,7,10,15` and "
#~ "evaluate a separate second-neighbor branch with `Pair Shell = 2`."

#~ msgid "生效条件：`target_mode` 使用手动索引时。"
#~ msgstr "Used when `target_mode` selects manual indices."

#~ msgid "生效条件：`pair_source` 选择手动索引时。"
#~ msgstr "Used when `pair_source` selects manual indices."

#~ msgid "生效条件：`pair_source` 选择近邻自动搜索时。"
#~ msgstr "Used when `pair_source` selects automatic neighbor search."

#~ msgid "生效条件：`bond_filter_mode` 不是关闭状态时。"
#~ msgstr "Used when `bond_filter_mode` is not `Any`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 `True`。额外输出一帧未偏转的参考磁态，方便做 energy "
#~ "difference 对比。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `True`. Include one untilted reference state for direct "
#~ "energy-difference comparisons."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `'Existing initial magmoms'`。已有 `initial_magmoms` 时复用它"
#~ "最安全；没有磁矩输入时用 `magmom_map`/`default_moment` 构造幅值。不要用默"
#~ "认幅值替代已知元素磁矩。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `'Existing initial magmoms'`. Reusing existing "
#~ "`initial_magmoms` is safest. Without moment input, construct magnitudes "
#~ "from `magmom_map` and `default_moment`; never replace known element "
#~ "moments with a generic default."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 `0.0`。只作为 `magmom_map` 未命中元素的兜底幅值。关键磁性元"
#~ "素应显式列出，非磁元素通常保持 0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.0`. Used only when an element is absent from "
#~ "`magmom_map`. List important magnetic elements explicitly; nonmagnetic "
#~ "elements should normally remain at 0."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 `100`。自动 pair、角度列表和正负手性会相乘放大输出数量。先用 "
#~ "20-100 检查 pair 选择是否合理，确认后再扩大到完整 DMI 扫描。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `100`. Automatic pairs, angles, and chirality signs "
#~ "multiply the output count. Start with 20–100 outputs to validate pair "
#~ "selection before expanding to a full DMI scan."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出只有参考态没有 canting 帧。** 检查是否有符合条件的磁性原子（有非零磁"
#~ "矩的 eligible 元素）。`apply_elements` 是否过滤掉了所有目标？pair 模式下找"
#~ "到的对是否为空？"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Only the reference state is produced.** Confirm that eligible atoms "
#~ "have nonzero moments, that `apply_elements` does not exclude all targets, "
#~ "and, in a pair mode, that at least one pair passes the filters."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**pair 自动找对结果不对。** 调整 `pair_shell_tolerance`——太大把不同壳层并"
#~ "到一起，太小把同一壳层拆开。检查 `pair_element_filter` 和 "
#~ "`pair_group_filter` 是否过紧。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Automatic pair selection is incorrect.** Tune `pair_shell_tolerance`: "
#~ "too large merges distinct shells, while too small splits one shell. Also "
#~ "check whether `pair_element_filter` or `pair_group_filter` is overly "
#~ "restrictive."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**group pair canting 没生效。** 输入需要 `arrays['group']` 且包含 "
#~ "`group_a` 和 `group_b` 指定的标签。用 `Group Label` 先生成。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Group-pair canting has no effect.** The input must contain "
#~ "`arrays['group']` with the exact labels in `group_a` and `group_b`. Add "
#~ "them with `Group Label` first."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出数量多于预期。** `Target Mode = All eligible atoms` + `Both (+/- "
#~ "pair)` 会快速膨胀。设 `max_outputs` 上限或改用 `First eligible atom`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The output count is larger than expected.** `Target Mode = All eligible "
#~ "atoms` combined with `Both (+/- pair)` multiplies targets and signs. Set "
#~ "`max_outputs` or use `First eligible atom` for an initial check."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "无随机性。相同输入、相同参数 → 严格一致输出。`reference_direction` 会先对"
#~ "基准磁矩方向正交化，结果是确定性的。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Deterministic. Identical inputs and parameters produce identical output. "
#~ "`reference_direction` is orthogonalized against the baseline moment "
#~ "direction in a deterministic way."
